{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃーーん!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG0TQPJY9F59KBXHJFSHMQY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今後の欅坂46の活動に生かせるようにとお勉強のために買いました!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うるうるが止まらないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欅坂46もライブで皆さんと1つになれるような楽曲が生まれたらいいなと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに私は『月の大きさ』のミュージックビデオが1番好きです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそしてどうしても欲しいってお願いしたらお兄ちゃんがわざわざ買ってきてくれました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG0TS0KP6C8H1X7YX0S2EA7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀未央奈さんと星野みなみさんのライブグッズです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欅坂に入る前まで握手会に行くくらい本当に大好きでした(   ; - ;   )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん今でも大好きです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はいい夢見れそうだ〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG0TT0PZWJS1A9T8P5QE4KR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい!ふぉ。"}],"source":"archive"}